id: SAVE24-1
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: ops_record
target: crates/core/src/ops_record.rs
find:             *prev = text;
replace:             drop(text);
expect-fail: consecutive_drafts_fold_to_last
expect-fail: whitespace_only_submit_is_not_recorded
expect-fail: property_ops_follow_call_order
note: 連続する下書きを畳むとき最後の値で置き換えない（最初の値が残る）
